<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>法院裁决后，Bawag 的 16 亿欧元 PTSB 交易存在不确定性</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/irish-high-court-refuses-to-approve-bawag-s-ptsb-deal</link><description>当爱尔兰法院裁定奥地利银行未满足所有程序要求时，Bawag Group AG 计划以 16 亿欧元（18 亿美元）收购 Permanent TSB Group Holdings Plc 的计划陷入不确定性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/irish-high-court-refuses-to-approve-bawag-s-ptsb-deal'&gt;法院裁决后，Bawag 的 16 亿欧元 PTSB 交易存在不确定性&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bawag’s €1.6 Billion PTSB Deal Uncertain After Court Ruling&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/irish-high-court-refuses-to-approve-bawag-s-ptsb-deal</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:09:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Futures Rally as Tech Rebound Gains Momentum: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</link><description>中国国务院在罕见的午间会议上重申了对资本市场的支持，强调了所谓国家队的作用，并承诺推出更多稳定股市的政策。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release'&gt;中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China Drives Biggest Stock Gain Since 2024 With Rare Midday Vow&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:00:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Kospi 溃败导致韩国养老基金资产损失 1,510 亿美元</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/kospi-rout-wipes-151-billion-from-korea-pension-fund-s-assets</link><description>由于股市下跌侵蚀了今年早些时候积累的部分巨额收益，韩国国家养老金管理局第三季度资产缩水约 202 万亿韩元（合 1,514 亿美元）。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/kospi-rout-wipes-151-billion-from-korea-pension-fund-s-assets'&gt;Kospi 溃败导致韩国养老基金资产损失 1,510 亿美元&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Kospi Rout Wipes $151 Billion From Korea Pension Fund’s Assets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/kospi-rout-wipes-151-billion-from-korea-pension-fund-s-assets</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:53:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢旺达凭借旅游业赢得 F1 主办权（视频）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/rwanda-wins-f1-hosting-rights-in-bet-on-tourism-video</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/rwanda-wins-f1-hosting-rights-in-bet-on-tourism-video'&gt;卢旺达凭借旅游业赢得 F1 主办权（视频）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rwanda Wins F1 Hosting Rights in Bet on Tourism (Video)&lt;/small